        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abram's wife Sarai had not borne him any children. But she had an Egyptian slave woman named Hagar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and so she said to Abram, “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has kept me from having children. Why don't you sleep with my slave? Perhaps she can have a child for me.” Abram agreed with what Sarai said. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So she gave Hagar to him to be his concubine. (This happened after Abram had lived in Canaan for ten years.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abram had intercourse with Hagar, and she became pregnant. When she found out that she was pregnant, she became proud and despised Sarai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Sarai said to Abram, “It's your fault that Hagar despises me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "It's your fault",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "me",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "May you suffer for this wrong done against me.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I myself gave her to you, and ever since she found out that she was pregnant, she has despised me. May the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " judge which of us is right, you or me!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abram answered, “Very well, she is your slave and under your control; do whatever you want with her.” Then Sarai treated Hagar so cruelly that she ran away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The angel of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " met Hagar at a spring in the desert on the road to Shur ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and said, “Hagar, slave of Sarai, where have you come from and where are you going?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She answered, “I am running away from my mistress.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He said, “Go back to her and be her slave.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he said, “I will give you so many descendants that no one will be able to count them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You are going to have a son, and you will name him Ishmael,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ishmael",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": This name in Hebrew means “God hears”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has heard your cry of distress. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But your son will live like a wild donkey; he will be against everyone, and everyone will be against him. He will live apart from all his relatives.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hagar asked herself, “Have I really seen God and lived to tell about it?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "lived to tell about it?",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " So she called the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " who had spoken to her “A God who Sees”. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That is why people call the well between Kadesh and Bered “The Well of the Living One who Sees Me”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
